  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Stabbable Settings (Scriptable Object)


    Required Velocity: Incoming
    stabber must collide with a greater velocity to start a stab.

    Outer Shell
    Damper: Friction applied until the stabber has entered past the Outer Shell Thickness.

    Damper:
    Friction applied after the outer shell has been breached.

    Inner Damper Curve:
    Animation Curve that can apply scaled friction based on stab depth.


    Stab
    Depth Limit: Optionally Limit how far a stabber can enter the object.


    Lock
    Velocity | Lock Time: Stabber can become stuck if it''s velocity remains lower
    than the threshold for the Lock Time.

    Unlock Force: Once stuck, this amount
    of force must be applied to unlock the stabber.


    Full Stab Depth: Full Stab
    Event invoked on the Stabbable if the stabber passes this depth.

    Full Stab
    Reset Depth: Cannot cause another "Full Stab" until the stabber is pulled back
    to this depth.

'
