  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Stabber:


    Stab Anything: Allows the stabber to stab any collider
    even if a Stabbable component doesn''t exist.

    Ignore Velocity Check: Ignores
    the velocity check imposed by the stabbable settings.

    Is Dual Stabber: Can
    have two stabbing tips (double sided spear).

    Can Run Through: Allows the
    stabber to completely go through and out the other side of an object.



    Stabber
    Settings (Scriptable Object)


    Angle Threshold: Dot product against the stab
    vector and the collision must be greater than this.

    Sharpness: Higher sharpness
    levels allows the stabber to bypass the friction settings of stabbables.

    Unstab
    Threshold: Stabber tip must be pulled back beyond the entry point by this amount
    to unstab.

    Unstab Delay: Time beyond the unstab threshold that must be met
    to unstab.

    Allowed Stabs: The amount of stabbable objects the stabber can
    stab at once.

    Perpendicular Threshold: Lateral distance check against the
    stab line to stop the stab.


    Knife: Low Sharpness (.3)

    Arrow: High
    Sharpness (.7)

    Spear: High Sharpness (.8) Double sided and can "Run Through"
    a stabbable object.

    Sword: Medium Sharpness (.5)'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
